doc: Find across the fleet, then commit the result set to a batch operator
given standard
when keys ;
then view = find
when keys d i r t y
then find = dirty
then matches = repo:dirty repo:dirty-pr
when keys a
then view = find
when keys s
then selected = dirty dirty-pr
when keys ! f s r
then view = batch
then task = Fetch All (marked)
then total = 2
